#! ia 1.0

@schema capability
  lowers to definition
  sections
    must have meaning
    may have composition
    must have execution
    may have relationships
    closed
  fields
    must have meaning.says as text
    must have meaning.answers as text
    may have composition.operations as list of ref
    may have composition.playbooks as list of ref
    may have composition.templates as list of ref
    may have composition.checks as list of ref
    may have composition.includes as list of ref
    may have execution.input as id
    may have execution.outcomes as id
    may have execution.context-profile as id
    may have execution.procedure-profile as id
    may have execution.mapping-profile as id
    must have execution.effects as list of id
    may have execution.limit-steps as number
    may have execution.limit-model-calls as number
    may have execution.limit-operations as number
    may have execution.limit-tokens as number
    may have execution.limit-children as number
    may have execution.limit-depth as number
    may have execution.limit-bytes as number
    may have execution.limit-duration-ms as number
